    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 3484,
        "text": "THE OAK (wood-hollow): the hollow at its foot, the trunk, the crown: one room, no seam (plan r3 item 3)"
      },
      {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 3544,
        "text": "W: in from wood-glidewalk at floor level"
      },
      {
        "x": 1150,
        "y": 3604,
        "text": "P3 moon patch. THE GLIMPSE (hold 180): the camera looks up the trunk; the firefly hangs W-ff in frame"
      },
      {
        "x": 1700,
        "y": 3764,
        "text": "the MOTH-STONE: the area on the map; its carving: moths climbing the oak"
      },
      {
        "x": 2200,
        "y": 3764,
        "text": "the first firefly sign at the trunk's foot: a ring of picked glow-cap stumps"
      },
      {
        "x": 2580,
        "y": 3584,
        "text": "Tatter under the trunk, looking up at W-ff: it can't climb. Her kicks slide too (claws: R10's glade 2)"
      },
      {
        "x": 2580,
        "y": 3944,
        "text": "the root mesh (one-way; no drop-through until wood-climbout): up from the climb-out, then the shortcut down to P4"
      },
      {
        "x": 2580,
        "y": 3200,
        "text": "catch rungs across the column every ~550 (one-ways: she kicks up through them, a fall lands on one)"
      },
      {
        "x": 3300,
        "y": 3764,
        "text": "E arch: the one way on before the claws, east to the hawkers' clearing"
      },
      {
        "x": 2200,
        "y": 2300,
        "text": "REST LEDGE: W-rest's cut spots; dang-knot drops on them from under the bridge"
      },
      {
        "x": 2700,
        "y": 2200,
        "text": "P-ledge (moon patch) on the buttress, out of W-rest's light; the column's east face is slick under it"
      },
      {
        "x": 1820,
        "y": 2520,
        "text": "THE DARK WAY: the hole at the ledge's back, the tunnel, the chimney (no lamps, slower) to the bridge"
      },
      {
        "x": 2960,
        "y": 1780,
        "text": "the near face holds up to W-ff; a slick stretch with the thorn band over it"
      },
      {
        "x": 2600,
        "y": 1860,
        "text": "the glow-cap ledge: stand under W-ff, out of its pull; jump up into it"
      },
      {
        "x": 2420,
        "y": 1560,
        "text": "W-ff (lit after the glimpse): caught, beat free up-left: thrown onto the knot bridge"
      },
      {
        "x": 2140,
        "y": 1270,
        "text": "the knot bridge: from its tip, walk off and down-cut W-ff (pogo snuff); on to the foothold over the thorns"
      },
      {
        "x": 1480,
        "y": 1080,
        "text": "FIND: bark knot, W-knot behind it"
      },
      {
        "x": 2600,
        "y": 980,
        "text": "the open crown: W-crown off the rim's lip; hawk-crown swoops through its orbit on a rhythm (perches 260 each side); a mistimed catch drops her onto the catch ledge"
      },
      {
        "x": 3090,
        "y": 360,
        "text": "the root's knot (one cut): the root falls down the trunk; Tatter climbs"
      },
      {
        "x": 3380,
        "y": 330,
        "text": "P5, THE CROWN (finale hold 540): the look-out, the cloud lifts off; the gate opens when it has gone"
      },
      {
        "x": 2000,
        "y": 220,
        "text": "postgame: the lantern over the crown gap (the Fling promise)"
      }
    ],
